  "title": "Strassburgare",
  "description": "Tender and delicate Swedish butter cookies are made with a cookie press and your favorite decorative tip. Color the dough your desired shade of red or green if you like. Using potato flour helps eliminate toughness.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda T"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-06-06T19:43:25-04:00",
